# Names of the Worker secrets this app reads. Copy to apps/web/.dev.vars (gitignored) and fill
# in only what you need locally; never commit .dev.vars or a real value.
#
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET: signs sessions and derives the account keys (docs/accounts.md). Set a
# random value of at least 32 characters, for example the output of `openssl rand -base64 32`.
# Without it, local runs use a random per-isolate secret and sessions end on restart. Staging
# and production use Worker secrets set by the owner.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
#
# USESEND_API_KEY: the useSend API key for transactional email (docs/email.md). Staging and
# production read it from a Worker secret (`wrangler secret put USESEND_API_KEY --env staging`
# or `--env production`). Local development never sends email, so it does not need one.
USESEND_API_KEY=
